Copyright (c) 2026 fatal10110

This package groups the objects spine-unity stores in Unity files. It holds no
code of the Spine Runtimes (Esoteric Software): it only looks objects up by the
names of the fields spine-unity serializes (skeletonJSON, atlasAssets,
atlasFile, materials, textureLoadingMode). Spine is a product and trademark of
Esoteric Software; this package is not affiliated with it.

The Unity format handling it relies on is in unity-asset-reader, a derivative
of AssetStudio (MIT, Perfare / RazTools / Razviar); see that package's NOTICE.
